## 4. Investment Thesis & Peer Comparison
Core thesis: TLT offers a hedge against inflation but is highly sensitive to interest rate changes. While it provides duration exposure, its structural risks make it a speculative play rather than a core holding.  

Peer comparison: TLT is similar to AGG (a broad U.S. bond ETF) but with significantly higher duration, making it riskier. Unlike AGG, TLT lacks diversification across maturities, amplifying rate sensitivity.  

